                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I recently introduced the Medical Device Electronic Labeling Act, a commonsense bill to modernize medical device labeling and eliminate unnecessary costs. By allowing more devices to use electronic labeling, we can streamline access to critical information for healthcare providers while reducing waste. This is a simple change that supports innovation and efficiency in our healthcare system.",
