                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week I hosted a virtual town hall focused on the issues that matter most to seniors in California\u2019s 23rd District\u2014protecting Social Security and Medicare, improving veterans' care, and strengthening our economy. Thank you to the thousands who joined me and asked thoughtful questions. I\u2019ll always fight to protect the benefits you\u2019ve earned and ensure your voice is heard in Washington.",
