                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Melanie from Redlands applied for Social Security and Medicare in January but didn\u2019t hear back for months. After she contacted my office, we were able to quickly resolve her problem. If you need help with a federal agency, stop by one of our mobile office hours or visit our main district office in Hesperia. We\u2019re here to serve you",
