                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicaid is on an unsustainable trajectory. Today, I supported legislation to strengthen Medicaid and ensure it\u2019s there for the people who depend on it- children, pregnant women, individuals with disabilities, and seniors. We're securing the future of the program by increasing accountability so it can continue to serve as a critical safety net for our fellow Americans for years to come.",
