                "text": "I enjoyed connecting with Twentynine Palms Councilmember April Ramirez to discuss expanding healthcare access for veterans in rural areas. We're working on solutions such as mobile medical services to better serve communities like Twentynine Palms. https://t.co/RcfdsnLmkf",
