                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am proud to cosponsor the ABC-ED Act to help hospitals track bed capacity and reduce emergency room overcrowding. This will improve care in the High Desert and Inland Empire, support our healthcare workers, and ensure patients get timely treatment.",
