                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I met with my Veteran Advisory Committee to hear directly from those who have served our nation. Our veterans deserve the very best care and support, and I am committed to holding the VA accountable, expanding healthcare access, and improving job training programs that help veterans transition successfully to civilian life.",
