                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A constituent from Crestline reached out to my office after paying her Medicare premiums but not having her benefits reinstated. She had endured weeks of uncertainty without coverage. We contacted the Social Security Administration on her behalf, clarified her information and benefits, and were able to get her coverage reinstated and a new insurance card issued to her shortly thereafter. If you need help with a federal agency, stop by one of our September mobile office hours or visit our main district office in Hesperia. We\u2019re here to serve you!",
