                "text": "California\u2019s insurance crisis is getting worse. Homeowners are being dropped, rates are soaring, and families are being left without options because of failed state policies that drove insurers out of our market. It\u2019s time to fix this broken system and restore competition so Californians can protect their homes. \nhttps://t.co/LwXDWbxOUo",
