                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Expiring pandemic health insurance tax credits are the primary reason Senate Democrats have cited for voting against reopening the government. But these subsidies are only responsible for about 3% of total insurance 2026 premiums. The Paragon Health Institute notes that  \u201cThe real drivers are the same structural flaws that have plagued ObamaCare since 2014 and rising health care costs\u201d. Extending these temporary subsidies won\u2019t address the fundamental flaws in ObamaCare.",
