                "text": "I was honored to receive the Association of Mature American Citizens (AMAC) PATRIOT Award! AMAC is a strong advocate for our seniors, and I am grateful for their continued partnership as we work to strengthen Medicare, protect Social Security, and ensure our seniors have access to the care and benefits they\u2019ve earned.",
